Licence of the served cores
---------------------------
The served cores contain picoTCP (core/deps/picotcp), which is licensed
under GPL version 2 or version 3 only. Every other part allows GPL version
2: Flycast and our code are version 2 or later, flycast-wasm is GPL-2.0,
and the rest is permissive or allows version 2. So each combined core is
distributed under the GNU General Public License, version 2 (the file
LICENSE). Patch 0023 (SOURCE.md section 8) keeps libcdio's iso9660.h and
DuckStation's achievements.cpp, which are GPL version 3, out of the
cores. Our own code and patches stay GPL-2.0-or-later.

No ROM
------
This repository contains no game ROM bytes and nothing derived from a ROM.
Players supply their own ROM, which never leaves their browser.
